cabal-version:      2.4
name:               terminal-size
version:            0.3.4
synopsis:           WASI stub: terminal size is unavailable in a browser
description:
    A drop-in replacement for the @terminal-size@ package used when building
    hledger for wasm32-wasi.
    .
    The real package determines the terminal window size with an @ioctl@ on a
    file descriptor. WASI has no such concept, and a browser has no terminal at
    all, so every entry point here reports "unknown size". hledger treats that
    as \"use the default report width\", which is the correct browser behaviour.
    .
    The version number matches the real @terminal-size@ so that hledger's
    version bounds are satisfied unchanged.
    .
    The module interface mirrors the BSD-3-Clause @terminal-size@ package by
    Evan Czaplicki and contributors.
license:            BSD-3-Clause
build-type:         Simple
category:           System

library
    exposed-modules:  System.Console.Terminal.Size
    build-depends:    base >=4 && <5
    hs-source-dirs:   .
    default-language: Haskell2010
